{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Easily design and develop your dream casino. Work together with friends to manage operations, satisfy the needs of eager gamblers, and watch the money roll in as you rise to the top of the gambling world.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Diverse Casino Facilities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring in all the classics\u2014roulette, card games, slots, lucky wheels, and more. Keep players engaged with variety, and upgrade your casino to boost profits with every bet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/\u5668\u5177.gif?t=1744232199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Build a Lavish Casino</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">It\u2019s not just about gambling. Add extra services like snacks and drinks to keep guests happy. Design every detail of your venue and turn it into the most impressive place in town.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/\u88c5\u9970.gif?t=1744232199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Stunning Visual Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Powered by Unreal Engine 5, the game offers a beautiful and realistic visual experience that brings your casino to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3412160/extras/\u663c\u591c.gif?t=1744232199\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Multiplayer Co-op for Shared Success</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re never alone in this game. Invite friends to help run the casino\u2014each person can focus on their strengths. Work as a team to experience the fun of managing together and becoming casino tycoons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps